9b513daa82b/comments", "author": null, "committer": null, "parents": [{"sha": "4bacb2bd0fbbcc2ba9a68a0ddab4fef5c77c735e", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/a0x8o/kubernetes/commits/4bacb2bd0fbbcc2ba9a68a0ddab4fef5c77c735e", "html_url": "https://github.com/a0x8o/kubernetes/commit/4bacb2bd0fbbcc2ba9a68a0ddab4fef5c77c735e"}]}, {"sha": "4ad0a0bcf607c06730fbdec4e73f53ef3439aa53", "node_id": "MDY6Q29tbWl0Njk0ODkxNDQ6NGFkMGEwYmNmNjA3YzA2NzMwZmJkZWM0ZTczZjUzZWYzNDM5YWE1Mw==", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Alex B", "email": "axbaretto@gmail.com", "date": "2018-04-18T01:54:56Z"}, "committer": {"name": "Alex B", "email": "axbaretto@gmail.com", "date": "2018-04-18T01:54:56Z"}, "message": "Update kazel to include openapi tag detection fix\n\nRemove unneeded deps from vendor\n\nAdding kube dns to kubemark\n\nGenerated files\n\nsample-apiserver: add v1beta1 with advanced conversion example from v1alpha1\n\nallow user to scale default backends\n\nbegin adding record flags struct\n\nFix kubelet flags.\n\nIncrease max requests inflight limits in gce for very large clusters\n\nUpdate kube-dns to Version 1.14.10. Major changes\n\nremove parallel\n\nkubelet: add configuration to optionally enable server tls bootstrap\n\nMove podsecuritypolicy registry to policy package.\n\nSet kubemark default verbosity to 4\n\nShow deprecated kube-apiserver flags\n\nCapture API call logs from kubemark apiserver\n\nAutocalculate ALLOWED_NOTREADY_NODES based on NUM_NODES\n\nAdd ConnectionReset, InternalError, etc also as retryable API errors\n\nSupport groups (organizations) to be specified in client cert.", "tree": {"sha": "d5a3800551149774d90236cc78b3bce79dfa4497", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/a0x8o/kubernetes/git/trees/d5a3800551149774d90236cc78b3bce79dfa4497"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/a0x8o/kubernetes/git/commits/4ad0a0bcf607c06730fbdec4e73f53ef3439aa53", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verifie