.com/users/a0x8o/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/a0x8o/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/a0x8o/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "78cda3d34fb1ccd004360063fe0c7778584b57e8", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/a0x8o/kubernetes/commits/78cda3d34fb1ccd004360063fe0c7778584b57e8", "html_url": "https://github.com/a0x8o/kubernetes/commit/78cda3d34fb1ccd004360063fe0c7778584b57e8"}]}, {"sha": "18c3bafffb586080f90925f5949661a553f8a101", "node_id": "MDY6Q29tbWl0Njk0ODkxNDQ6MThjM2JhZmZmYjU4NjA4MGY5MDkyNWY1OTQ5NjYxYTU1M2Y4YTEwMQ==", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Alex B", "email": "axbaretto@gmail.com", "date": "2018-02-22T05:30:10Z"}, "committer": {"name": "Alex B", "email": "axbaretto@gmail.com", "date": "2018-02-22T05:30:10Z"}, "message": "This closes #4710: Uses output directory with custom FileNaming in FileIO.write\nA relative directory should be applied (if specified) even when using a custom filenaming scheme\n[BEAM-3701][BEAM-3700] ensure pipeline options setup is using contextual classloader and not defaulting to beam-sdk classloader\n[BEAM-3565] Break fusion for a ParDo which has State or Timers\nBreak fusion for a ParDo which has State or Timers\nFixing nanosecond translation issue in Gauge Fn API translation.\nMerge pull request #4702: [BEAM-3715] Explicitly exclude some troublesome optional deps\nExplicitly exclude some troublesome optional deps from hadoop-input-format\nensure pipeline options setup is using contextual classloader and not defaulting to beam-sdk classloader\nSpotless gradle: remove extraneous globbing of all java everywhere\n[BEAM-3640] part 2 - add STATIC_INIT,INSTANCE_INIT,ENUM_DEF,INTERFACE_DEF,CTOR_DEF lf's\nUse maven-publish plugin to publish java artifacts\nPlumbing Gauge metrics through the Fn API.\nRevert invalid use of io.StringIO in utils/profiler.py\n[BEAM-3683] Supports BigQuery column-based partitioning\nUpdates BigQuery documentation\nfixup! fixup! [BEAM-3456] Re-enable JDBC performance test\nfixup! [BEAM-3456] Re-enable JDBC performance test\n[BEAM-3456] Re-enable JDBC performance test\n[BEAM-3662] Port MongoDbIOTest off DoFnTester\nUpdates javadocs of Setup and Teardown\n[BEAM-3690] swapping to use mockito-core, hamcrest-core and hamcrest-library to solve the dependency conflicts\n[BEAM-3690] swapping to use mockito-core, hamcrest-core and hamcrest-library to solve the dependency conflicts replace mockito-all", "tree": {"sha": "37665f0dea3d26e91b9d00586e709d8d17818763", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/a0x8o/kubernetes/git/trees/37665f0dea3d26e91b9d00586e709d8d17818763"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/a0x8o/kubernetes/git/commits/18c3bafffb586080f90925f5949661a553f8a101", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/a0x8o/kubernetes/commits/18c3bafffb586080f90925f5949661a553f8a101", "html_url": "https://github.com/a0x8o/kubernetes/commit/18c3bafffb586080f90925f5949661a553f8a101", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/a0x8o/kubernetes/commits/18c3bafffb586080f90925f5949661a553f8a101/comments", "author": {"login": "a0x8o", "id": 22206500, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjA2NTAw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22206500?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/a0x8o", "html_url": "https://github.com/a0x8o", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/a0x8o/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/a0x8o/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/a0x8o/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/a0x8o/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/a0x8o/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/a0x8o/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/a0x8o/repos", "events_u